  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Literature Overview for Type Hints",
      "source_hash": 10525641279319208816,
      "context_hash": 16530898886277989957,
      "translation": "타입 힌트를 위한 문헌 개관",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:32:27.305964Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Abstract",
      "source_hash": 14205428931693966264,
      "context_hash": 4734024464837218326,
      "translation": "초록",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:32:27.305970Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "This PEP is one of three related to type hinting.",
      "source_hash": 16674946360789285975,
      "context_hash": 17360925332283917981,
      "translation": "이 PEP는 타입 힌트와 관련된 세 개의 PEP 중 하나입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:32:27.305971Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "This PEP gives a literature overview of related work.",
      "source_hash": 14414899658647443801,
      "context_hash": 1064971294140972103,
      "translation": "이 PEP는 관련 작업에 대한 문헌 개관을 제공합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:32:27.305971Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "The main spec is :pep:`484`.",
      "source_hash": 6913932602558925473,
      "context_hash": 10499994540453633994,
      "translation": "주요 명세는 :pep:`484`\\ 입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:32:27.305971Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Existing Approaches for Python",
      "source_hash": 8193610884637275559,
      "context_hash": 1665353342679845323,
      "translation": "파이썬을 위한 기존 접근법",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:32:27.305972Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "mypy",
      "source_hash": 8557553583587484793,
      "context_hash": 5535376036257106947,
      "translation": "mypy",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:32:27.305972Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "(This section is a stub, since `mypy`__ is essentially what we're proposing.)",
      "source_hash": 14044505081205144376,
      "context_hash": 16891036311609028433,
      "translation": "(이 절은 초안 상태입니다. `mypy`__\\ 가 본질적으로 우리가 제안하는 것이기 때문입니다.)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:32:27.305972Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "__ https://mypy-lang.org",
      "source_hash": 4485586111286758254,
      "context_hash": 1203184272844521685,
      "translation": "__ https://mypy-lang.org",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:32:27.305973Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Reticulated Python",
      "source_hash": 12958855829542551923,
      "context_hash": 3004299987742386598,
      "translation": "Reticulated Python",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:32:27.305973Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "`Reticulated Python`__ by Michael Vitousek is an example of a slightly different approach to gradual typing for Python.",
      "source_hash": 4958001968696477172,
      "context_hash": 11306783133045487711,
      "translation": "Michael Vitousek의 `Reticulated Python`__\\ 은 파이썬을 위한 점진적 타이핑에 대한 약간 다른 접근법의 예입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:32:27.305974Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "It is described in an actual `academic paper`__ written by Vitousek with Jeremy Siek and Jim Baker (the latter of Jython fame).",
      "source_hash": 3444544255251712108,
      "context_hash": 14978946538997333543,
      "translation": "이는 Vitousek이 Jeremy Siek, Jim Baker(후자는 Jython으로 유명함)와 함께 작성한 실제 `academic paper`__\\ 에서 설명됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:32:27.305974Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "__ https://github.com/mvitousek/reticulated __ http://wphomes.soic.indiana.edu/jsiek/files/2014/03/retic-python.pdf",
      "source_hash": 1292739420800493764,
      "context_hash": 3059818376034254832,
      "translation": "__ https://github.com/mvitousek/reticulated __ http://wphomes.soic.indiana.edu/jsiek/files/2014/03/retic-python.pdf",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:32:27.305975Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "PyCharm",
      "source_hash": 10323088502175754,
      "context_hash": 10242082619796196812,
      "translation": "PyCharm",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:32:27.305975Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "PyCharm by JetBrains has been providing a way to specify and check types for about four years.",
      "source_hash": 15195091527643192388,
      "context_hash": 11934449116599648218,
      "translation": "JetBrains의 PyCharm은 약 4년 동안 타입을 지정하고 검사하는 방법을 제공해 왔습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:32:27.305975Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "The type system suggested by PyCharm__ grew from simple class types to tuple types, generic types, function types, etc. based on feedback of many users who shared their experience of using type hints in their code.",
      "source_hash": 12637881471030783685,
      "context_hash": 7992448644362086376,
      "translation": "PyCharm__\\ 이 제안한 타입 시스템은 코드에서 타입 힌트를 사용한 경험을 공유한 많은 사용자의 피드백을 바탕으로 단순한 클래스 타입에서 튜플 타입, 제네릭 타입, 함수 타입 등으로 발전했습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:32:27.305976Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "__ https://github.com/JetBrains/python-skeletons#types",
      "source_hash": 1650625347636588753,
      "context_hash": 13428400452836504560,
      "translation": "__ https://github.com/JetBrains/python-skeletons#types",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:32:27.305977Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Others",
      "source_hash": 110373985552153196,
      "context_hash": 16245692735352746354,
      "translation": "기타",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:32:27.305977Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "TBD: Add sections on pyflakes__, pylint__, numpy__, `Argument Clinic`__, pytypedecl__, numba__, obiwan__.",
      "source_hash": 11400422185819235843,
      "context_hash": 12831251995894119639,
      "translation": "TBD: pyflakes__, pylint__, numpy__, `Argument Clinic`__, pytypedecl__, numba__, obiwan__\\ 에 대한 절을 추가할 것.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:32:27.305978Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "__ https://github.com/pyflakes/pyflakes/ __ https://www.pylint.org __ https://www.numpy.org __ https://docs.python.org/3/howto/clinic.html __ https://github.com/google/pytypedecl __ https://numba.pydata.org __ https://pypi.org/project/obiwan",
      "source_hash": 11038771184940069987,
      "context_hash": 11026441417856964317,
      "translation": "__ https://github.com/pyflakes/pyflakes/ __ https://www.pylint.org __ https://www.numpy.org __ https://docs.python.org/3/howto/clinic.html __ https://github.com/google/pytypedecl __ https://numba.pydata.org __ https://pypi.org/project/obiwan",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:32:27.305978Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Existing Approaches in Other Languages",
      "source_hash": 10483940998103969340,
      "context_hash": 10085423080428884030,
      "translation": "다른 언어의 기존 접근법",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:32:27.305978Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "ActionScript",
      "source_hash": 4148839187412565173,
      "context_hash": 7020631216010331186,
      "translation": "ActionScript",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:32:27.305979Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "ActionScript__ is a class-based, single inheritance, object-oriented superset of ECMAScript.",
      "source_hash": 9617671293976832656,
      "context_hash": 5792061523438703760,
      "translation": "ActionScript__\\ 는 클래스 기반의 단일 상속 객체 지향 ECMAScript의 상위 집합입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:32:27.305979Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "It supports interfaces and strong runtime-checked static typing.",
      "source_hash": 11548661234630058776,
      "context_hash": 10522284936544693648,
      "translation": "이는 인터페이스와 런타임에 강하게 검사되는 정적 타이핑을 지원합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:32:27.305979Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "Compilation supports a “strict dialect” where type mismatches are reported at compile-time.",
      "source_hash": 4779067787411458284,
      "context_hash": 12301053871162803155,
      "translation": "컴파일은 타입 불일치가 컴파일 시점에 보고되는 \"엄격한 방언(strict dialect)\"을 지원합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:32:27.305980Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "__ https://livedocs.adobe.com/specs/actionscript/3/",
      "source_hash": 17678177413142909843,
      "context_hash": 5408149213975163494,
      "translation": "__ https://livedocs.adobe.com/specs/actionscript/3/",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:32:27.305980Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Example code with types",
      "source_hash": 16095674578160546140,
      "context_hash": 15591703453426291114,
      "translation": "타입이 포함된 예제 코드",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:32:27.305980Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Dart",
      "source_hash": 365249617922320661,
      "context_hash": 2842988069029275446,
      "translation": "Dart",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:32:27.305980Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Dart__ is a class-based, single inheritance, object-oriented language with C-style syntax.",
      "source_hash": 17246086855562124678,
      "context_hash": 6921807846373996638,
      "translation": "Dart__\\ 는 C 스타일 문법을 가진 클래스 기반의 단일 상속 객체 지향 언어입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:32:27.305981Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "It supports interfaces, abstract classes, reified generics, and optional typing.",
      "source_hash": 11630348645396428927,
      "context_hash": 13643992749320858069,
      "translation": "이는 인터페이스, 추상 클래스, 구체화된 제네릭, 선택적 타이핑을 지원합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:32:27.305981Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "__ https://www.dartlang.org",
      "source_hash": 9050537614949795008,
      "context_hash": 375477420460231651,
      "translation": "__ https://www.dartlang.org",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:32:27.305981Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Types are inferred when possible.",
      "source_hash": 18301836255854186091,
      "context_hash": 15110963433771892259,
      "translation": "가능한 경우 타입이 추론됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:26:06.267203Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "The runtime differentiates between two modes of execution: *checked mode* aimed for development (catching type errors at runtime) and *production mode* recommended for speed execution (ignoring types and asserts).",
      "source_hash": 11506840366509146227,
      "context_hash": 10546052881511061647,
      "translation": "런타임은 두 가지 실행 모드, 즉 개발을 위해 설계되어 런타임에 타입 오류를 잡아내는 *checked mode*\\ 와 속도 실행을 위해 권장되며 타입과 assert를 무시하는 *production mode*\\ 를 구분합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:26:06.267293Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Example code with types",
      "source_hash": 16095674578160546140,
      "context_hash": 17346199370408759239,
      "translation": "타입을 사용한 예제 코드",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:26:06.267294Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:10/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Hack",
      "source_hash": 16103147517018458887,
      "context_hash": 4653044063928519984,
      "translation": "Hack",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:26:06.267295Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:10/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Hack__ is a programming language that interoperates seamlessly with PHP.",
      "source_hash": 7706834734428157821,
      "context_hash": 4138302407302215506,
      "translation": "Hack__\\ 은 PHP와 매끄럽게 상호운용되는 프로그래밍 언어입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:26:06.267295Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:10/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "It provides opt-in static type checking, type aliasing, generics, nullable types, and lambdas.",
      "source_hash": 15229571207076704779,
      "context_hash": 6183408527883186197,
      "translation": "옵트인 방식의 정적 타입 검사, 타입 별칭, 제네릭, nullable 타입, 람다를 제공합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:26:06.267295Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:10/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "__ https://hacklang.org",
      "source_hash": 18068908862335115360,
      "context_hash": 17849735111718321347,
      "translation": "__ https://hacklang.org",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:26:06.267296Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:10/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Example code with types",
      "source_hash": 16095674578160546140,
      "context_hash": 9708218832530784376,
      "translation": "타입을 사용한 예제 코드",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:26:06.267296Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:11/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "TypeScript",
      "source_hash": 11750829014300155684,
      "context_hash": 1976510323875114753,
      "translation": "TypeScript",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:26:06.267296Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:11/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "TypeScript__ is a typed superset of JavaScript that adds interfaces, classes, mixins and modules to the language.",
      "source_hash": 8909519119861870412,
      "context_hash": 1569794531912199019,
      "translation": "TypeScript__\\ 는 언어에 인터페이스, 클래스, 믹스인, 모듈을 추가한, 타입이 있는 JavaScript의 상위 집합입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:26:06.267296Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:11/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "__ http://www.typescriptlang.org",
      "source_hash": 6816996205577890191,
      "context_hash": 9098804170571114909,
      "translation": "__ http://www.typescriptlang.org",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:26:06.267297Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:11/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Type checks are duck typed.",
      "source_hash": 15216077552146866397,
      "context_hash": 3716437809873433334,
      "translation": "타입 검사는 덕 타이핑으로 이루어집니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:13:05.895288Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:11/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "Multiple valid function signatures are specified by supplying overloaded function declarations.",
      "source_hash": 13057918197007832240,
      "context_hash": 568365431396392888,
      "translation": "유효한 여러 함수 시그니처는 오버로드된 함수 선언을 제공하여 지정합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:13:05.895291Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:11/block:3/seg:2",
      "source": "Functions and classes can use generics as type parameterization.",
      "source_hash": 6006251709618365527,
      "context_hash": 8022493871554067988,
      "translation": "함수와 클래스는 타입 매개변수화를 위해 제네릭을 사용할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:13:05.895291Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:11/block:3/seg:3",
      "source": "Interfaces can have optional fields.",
      "source_hash": 9331203597321744362,
      "context_hash": 16384190488594672098,
      "translation": "인터페이스는 선택적 필드를 가질 수 있습니다.",
